{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《三代同糖》今晚（12日）劇情迎來虐心大轉折！何依婷飾演的朱圓圓（Emma）陪男友出席聚會時竟慘被冷待，事後更在李偉健飾演的家驄（Terry）面前徹底崩潰爆喊！看著平時霸氣十足的圓圓哭成淚人，Terry竟一反常態，罕有地霸氣外露，究竟他是否已對她動了真情？\n</p>\n<h2>何依婷遭男友冷待 街頭徹底崩潰</h2>\n<p>在最新一集中，朱圓圓（何依婷飾）滿心歡喜陪同男友高冠一（容天佑飾）出席朋友聚會，未料竟被完全冷落，受盡委屈。事後她在街頭遇上家驄（李偉健飾），一直強忍的情緒終於潰堤，昔日的霸氣消失得無影無蹤，在他面前哭得像個孩子。另一邊廂，家驄為了幫家姐嘉冰（車婉婉飾）減輕經濟負擔，忍痛將自己的心血結晶《圓嬤嬤正傳》版權賣給陳公子（許俊豪飾），被迫畫續集醜化圓圓，內心正充滿愧疚，面對圓圓的眼淚，他才驚覺自己對她的感情非比尋常。</p>\n<h2>李偉健Man爆護花 心軟屈服洩真情</h2>\n<p>看著圓圓伏在自己肩上痛哭，家驄一改以往扮傻鬥氣的常態，竟刻意板起臉孔，罕有地「Man到震」，粗聲粗氣地問：「你點先唔喊？」當圓圓哭著說要浸泡泡浴時，家驄最初斬釘截鐵地拒絕，嫌棄非常麻煩。但一見到圓圓哭得更大聲，他便瞬間心軟，無奈又寵溺地屈服說：「我整喇！」這句不經意的話語，似乎完全暴露了他對圓圓的真實心意，與他被迫畫《圓妃傳》醜化圓圓的愧疚感形成強烈對比。</p>\n<h2>李偉健幻想古裝色誘 大嗌「圓妃係我嘅」</h2>\n<p>劇中更會穿插一段搞笑的古裝幻想戲！李偉健與何依婷將分別化身「小春子」和「圓妃」，上演一幕幕爆笑場面，當中更有圓妃搞笑色誘小春子的情節。有趣的是，無論是在幻想世界還是現實中，家驄都會在不經意間大嗌「圓嬤嬤係屬於我㗎」、「圓妃娘娘係屬於我小春子嘅」，強烈的佔有慾完全藏不住，似乎預示著兩人的感情線即將有重大突破。</p>\n<h2>網民期待感情線發展：「Terry終於Man返次」</h2>\n<p>對於這對歡喜冤家的關係大躍進，網民紛紛表示期待，並在討論區洗版留言。有網民激動表示：「終於等到呢一日！Terry同Emma條線好有火花！」、「何依婷喊得好慘，睇到都心痛。」不少觀眾亦被李偉健的反差萌所吸引：「李偉健扮Man個下笑死，但又好冧！」、「『我整喇！』呢句好sweet，平時鬥氣估唔到佢咁溫柔。」更有網民催促劇情發展：「快啲一齊啦！頂唔順個正印男友啦！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_4103744766af5663259378.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_4103744766af5663259378.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_2878956706af5663fce4cc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_2878956706af5663fce4cc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_16154877386af5664427fd0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_16154877386af5664427fd0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_13569323226af56646f30ce.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_13569323226af56646f30ce.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_2896710776af5664b4075f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_2896710776af5664b4075f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_12608464046af5664e96874.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_12608464046af5664e96874.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_17547219806af56652a0b1d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_17547219806af56652a0b1d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_18747529766af566557d889.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_18747529766af566557d889.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_1388819426af56658e2220.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_1388819426af56658e2220.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_7397953116af5665cb7ed7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_7397953116af5665cb7ed7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_5796289326af5666078476.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_5796289326af5666078476.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_4361804156af566643f442.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_4361804156af566643f442.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_15254536006af56667a52ad.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_15254536006af56667a52ad.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T11:49:55.014234+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1294,"images":13,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T11:30:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T15:57:30.597782+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T11:43:29.738389+00:00","content_hash":"3195bdb3b8b69535f44c17acc93fea567a7b014a9cface6367f200ec80e7d60f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}